title: "AzureArcBRTips - Azure Arc Projects and Practical Guidance"
abstract: >-
  Collection of projects, Azure Monitor workbooks, scripts, deployment
  templates and practical guidance for Azure Arc. Each project documents
  its own purpose, prerequisites, usage, validation and version history.
  Includes an agent version compliance workbook with English and
  Brazilian Portuguese guides.
